                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Foreman: Sterling\nSlush paid the\ninspection bill.\nHe may own the",
                            "bill, but that is\nnot the same as\nowning the valve.\nTell the archive",
                            "clerk we still\nknow the\ndifference. Tell\nPip the kettle\ndoes not."
                          ],
